وى» 6/437</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=bn#s83a23\">ইন্টারঅ্যাকটিভ তাফসীরে খুলুন (পূর্ণ পাঠ)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/bn/ayah/83-21.html\">আগের আয়াত (83:21)</a><a href=\"/bn/ayah/83-27.html\">পরের আয়াত (83:27)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>তাফসীরুশ শাইখাইন · <a href=\"/bn/\">প্রথম পাতা</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">প্রকল্প সম্পর্কে</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">গোপনীয়তা ও শর্তাবলি</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/83-27.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"bn\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>তাফসীর Al-Mutaffifin 83:27 — ইবনে তাইমিয়া ও ইবনুল কাইয়্যিমের মতে</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"আর তার মিশ্রণ হবে তাস্নীমের ,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/83-27.html\">\n<link rel=\"alte